WEBVTT

00:02.580 --> 00:05.850
<b>So he was that doctor's assistant...</b>

00:08.800 --> 00:12.830
<b>Speaking of which,
where did our agent go off to now?</b>

00:13.230 --> 00:16.330
<b>He definitely was abandoned.</b>

00:16.330 --> 00:17.570
<b>Rest in peace.</b>

00:18.220 --> 00:19.970
<b>What a poor thing.</b>

00:19.970 --> 00:20.880
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:20.880 --> 00:23.100
<b>Hey, we met on the bus.</b>

00:23.100 --> 00:24.860
<b>Oh, the grave robber!</b>

00:24.860 --> 00:28.880
<b>Hey, couldn't you just say
it's a tomb raider instead?</b>

00:30.740 --> 00:33.690
<b>Oh, this doesn't look good.</b>

00:34.470 --> 00:36.050
<b>Tell me about it.</b>

00:36.050 --> 00:37.890
<b>I'll be on my way, then.</b>

00:37.890 --> 00:40.000
<b>Oh? You know where she went to?</b>

00:40.900 --> 00:42.040
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:42.040 --> 00:43.270
<b>Your partner, that is.</b>

00:44.060 --> 00:45.440
<b>How did you know?</b>

00:46.540 --> 00:48.120
<b>I just ran into her.</b>

00:48.520 --> 00:50.200
<b>Follow me, I'll take you to her.</b>

03:36.400 --> 03:39.320
<b>Morning, Rouge Redstar.</b>

03:39.790 --> 03:40.830
<b>Oh...</b>

03:41.680 --> 03:43.830
<b>Sorry for startling you.</b>

03:44.270 --> 03:46.520
<b>You are free to stay asleep.</b>

03:46.520 --> 03:48.580
<b>My dear Rouge.</b>

04:09.070 --> 04:10.400
<b>What a lovely song.</b>

04:10.900 --> 04:13.060
<b>Don't you think so, Rouge?</b>

04:13.060 --> 04:16.100
<b>Lovely? What's "lovely"?</b>

04:16.100 --> 04:20.620
<b>That means this song makes you
feel tiny when you play it.</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:24.590
<b>A song that Mom,
who made you and I, once loved.</b>

04:25.150 --> 04:26.470
<b>Mom...</b>

04:31.480 --> 04:34.750
<b>Why aren't you two
injecting yourself with this?</b>

04:35.340 --> 04:37.240
<b>Because we don't need it.</b>

04:40.340 --> 04:42.730
<b>We can eat this together.</b>

04:50.560 --> 04:51.710
<b>So tasty...</b>

05:02.380 --> 05:03.850
<b>Deform.</b>

05:17.120 --> 05:19.300
<b>Happy birthday...</b>

05:19.650 --> 05:21.550
<b>Happy birthday...</b>

05:21.840 --> 05:22.930
<b>Rouge.</b>

05:24.310 --> 05:25.180
<b>Rouge.</b>

05:25.930 --> 05:26.920
<b>Rouge.</b>

05:29.830 --> 05:32.140
<b>Rouge Redstar...</b>

05:32.140 --> 05:35.230
<b>O poor girl...</b>

05:35.230 --> 05:39.300
<b>You cannot escape from
where you are as you were born.</b>

05:43.660 --> 05:44.990
<b>Whoa!</b>

05:46.770 --> 05:48.100
<b>So, where is she?</b>

05:48.100 --> 05:49.000
<b>Over there...</b>

05:49.350 --> 05:50.050
<b>Somewhere.</b>

05:51.080 --> 05:54.330
<b>So you brought me here
with that random recognition?</b>

05:57.920 --> 05:59.640
<b>You're kidding me...</b>

06:01.570 --> 06:03.990
<b>We gotta get inside there.</b>

06:03.990 --> 06:06.460
<b>But we gotta bring down the ceiling, no?</b>

06:06.460 --> 06:08.960
<b>We won't be doing such a barbaric thing.</b>

06:17.240 --> 06:18.230
<b>Please let us through.</b>

06:26.680 --> 06:27.580
<b>But how?</b>

06:27.580 --> 06:28.780
<b>Bribery.</b>

06:30.270 --> 06:31.790
<b>Despite looking like this...</b>

06:32.130 --> 06:32.830
<b>It's a key.</b>

06:39.980 --> 06:41.460
<b>A War Machine...</b>

06:41.790 --> 06:44.470
<b>I knew it had something to do
with the usurpers.</b>

06:44.900 --> 06:46.180
<b>Usurpers...</b>

06:46.840 --> 06:47.890
<b>Unide.</b>

06:47.890 --> 06:51.440
<b>Oh, so you knew the name?
I see you're something else.</b>

06:52.370 --> 06:54.670
<b>Well, to each their own, I guess.</b>

06:54.670 --> 06:55.810
<b>See you.</b>

06:56.360 --> 06:57.390
<b>Where are you going?</b>

06:57.390 --> 07:00.840
<b>My job.
This is a mountain of treasures.</b>

07:01.960 --> 07:03.150
<b>Eden Vallock.</b>

07:03.540 --> 07:04.200
<b>Huh?</b>

07:05.720 --> 07:06.950
<b>My name.</b>

07:10.940 --> 07:11.760
<b>Bang.</b>

07:13.960 --> 07:15.370
<b>Do you love music?</b>

07:15.730 --> 07:19.260
<b>I don't know, I think I might.</b>

07:20.180 --> 07:21.420
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:21.770 --> 07:23.860
<b>There was this song
I once heard in the past.</b>

07:24.450 --> 07:25.510
<b>What kind?</b>

07:38.760 --> 07:39.960
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:40.400 --> 07:43.720
<b>I know that song,
but I'm not quite fond of it.</b>

07:44.520 --> 07:46.950
<b>It reminds me of the people I hate.</b>

07:55.510 --> 08:01.790
<b>♪ I see fallen stars among light ♪</b>

08:02.270 --> 08:08.700
<b>♪ I feel a glow in my heart ♪</b>

08:10.840 --> 08:13.080
<b>Why did you kill me?</b>

08:14.570 --> 08:16.730
<b>A Nean doesn't kill a fellow Nean.</b>

08:17.590 --> 08:19.400
<b>Rouge, the Kinslayer.</b>

08:19.650 --> 08:21.520
<b>Rouge, the betrayer of Neans.</b>

08:24.070 --> 08:26.990
<b>I'll take you to the next target!</b>

08:29.050 --> 08:30.010
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:32.980
<b>I am Jean Yunghart.</b>

08:33.660 --> 08:35.140
<b>Your brother.</b>

08:35.870 --> 08:36.910
<b>What is your name?</b>

08:37.960 --> 08:39.040
<b>Rouge...</b>

08:40.240 --> 08:41.670
<b>Rouge Redstar.</b>

08:42.340 --> 08:43.100
<b>Rouge...</b>

08:43.680 --> 08:45.060
<b>The red star.</b>

08:45.810 --> 08:48.690
<b>I'll take you to the next target!</b>

09:00.040 --> 09:01.600
<b>Rouge, the Kinslayer.</b>

09:02.440 --> 09:04.300
<b>Rouge, the betrayer of Neans.</b>

09:08.840 --> 09:10.740
<b>A Nean can't kill people.</b>

09:11.410 --> 09:12.480
<b>They won't.</b>

09:12.890 --> 09:13.910
<b>They can't.</b>

09:14.160 --> 09:15.240
<b>They won't.</b>

09:15.240 --> 09:16.240
<b>They can't.</b>

09:16.640 --> 09:17.820
<b>They won't.</b>

09:17.820 --> 09:18.910
<b>They can't.</b>

09:19.700 --> 09:22.420
<b>Code Eve.</b>

09:22.420 --> 09:23.960
<b>- They won't.
- Code Eve.</b>

09:23.960 --> 09:25.400
<b>- They can't.
- Code Eve.</b>

09:25.400 --> 09:26.200
<b>- They won't.
- Code Eve.</b>

09:26.200 --> 09:27.050
<b>- They can't.
- Code Eve.</b>

09:27.430 --> 09:36.920
<b>- They won't. They can't.
- Code Eve.</b>

09:59.320 --> 10:00.620
<b>Say "ah" now.</b>

10:04.330 --> 10:06.870
<b>Was he related to the usurpers?</b>

10:07.570 --> 10:09.590
<b>Found the target's id.</b>

10:09.880 --> 10:12.710
<b>Now I just gotta find the girl...</b>

10:16.320 --> 10:18.880
<b>They are Father's negative legacy.</b>

10:19.630 --> 10:20.910
<b>Negative legacy...</b>

10:21.380 --> 10:24.270
<b>Negative legacies have to be cleared.</b>

10:24.900 --> 10:26.650
<b>That was Father's wish.</b>

10:26.970 --> 10:30.900
<b>Yes. And they took our father's life.</b>

10:31.310 --> 10:33.790
<b>The Immortal Nine who killed Father...</b>

10:41.430 --> 10:42.600
<b>Unforgivable.</b>

10:46.120 --> 10:48.510
<b>We will accomplish it as siblings.</b>

10:48.510 --> 10:50.840
<b>We'll avenge our father together.</b>

10:51.280 --> 10:53.970
<b>This is a top-secret mission.
No one...</b>

10:54.280 --> 10:56.090
<b>...should ever know this.</b>

10:57.800 --> 10:59.970
<b>You should be aware of it.</b>

11:00.660 --> 11:02.980
<b>I should...</b>

11:05.240 --> 11:06.980
<b>You are aware of it.</b>

11:07.830 --> 11:10.300
<b>I am... aware.</b>

11:12.020 --> 11:14.110
<b>What happened to the Code Eve?</b>

11:15.960 --> 11:17.570
<b>Code Eve...</b>

11:18.120 --> 11:20.200
<b>Where is it located in you?</b>

11:22.100 --> 11:26.580
<b>The Immortal Nine are Neans
with special abilities.</b>

11:26.580 --> 11:30.200
<b>They are the parents to many Neans,</b>

11:30.200 --> 11:31.770
<b>the mother's bodies.</b>

11:32.280 --> 11:34.850
<b>They had been laying low for some time,</b>

11:34.850 --> 11:37.970
<b>but they started making a move again.</b>

11:37.970 --> 11:40.550
<b>They hate humans with passion.</b>

11:40.550 --> 11:44.480
<b>And your father tried to stop them,
but he lost his life.</b>

11:45.280 --> 11:47.620
<b>They are after the Code Eve.</b>

11:47.620 --> 11:51.530
<b>If they can release the Code Eve,
the world will reform.</b>

11:52.230 --> 11:53.910
<b>Reform...</b>

11:55.010 --> 11:56.600
<b>You and I together,</b>

11:56.600 --> 11:58.990
<b>we should accomplish
what our father couldn't.</b>

11:59.480 --> 12:00.140
<b>Rouge.</b>

12:01.690 --> 12:02.700
<b>But...</b>

12:03.020 --> 12:05.720
<b>I couldn't see Sara as a bad person.</b>

12:06.780 --> 12:09.040
<b>Afdal was suffering as well.</b>

12:09.780 --> 12:13.500
<b>He was looking so gloomy as he was
thinking of the suffering Neans.</b>

12:14.500 --> 12:17.760
<b>And yet, we still have to defeat them?</b>

12:19.150 --> 12:19.890
<b>Yes.</b>

12:20.640 --> 12:21.890
<b>But why?</b>

12:22.380 --> 12:23.390
<b>No matter what.</b>

12:24.900 --> 12:25.770
<b>But why?</b>

12:27.770 --> 12:30.520
<b>Who are you?</b>

12:32.620 --> 12:34.530
<b>A puppeteer.</b>

12:35.150 --> 12:37.150
<b>What did you do to me?</b>

12:37.500 --> 12:41.670
<b>My job is to assemble the poor dolls.</b>

12:41.670 --> 12:44.850
<b>And to save them.</b>

12:45.560 --> 12:48.260
<b>So you're saying I'm a poor doll?</b>

12:48.260 --> 12:51.200
<b>Aren't you, Rouge Redstar?</b>

12:52.400 --> 12:56.040
<b>And you are also lovable beings.</b>

12:56.040 --> 12:58.380
<b>Which is exactly why I cut the threads.</b>

12:59.170 --> 13:00.800
<b>The binding threads of a curse...</b>

13:00.800 --> 13:04.140
<b>...that you all aren't aware of,
controlling out of nowhere.</b>

13:04.140 --> 13:05.660
<b>I shall cut them.</b>

13:06.390 --> 13:08.730
<b>That is my job.</b>

13:09.240 --> 13:11.470
<b>And what will happen if you do?</b>

13:11.470 --> 13:13.060
<b>You can be free.</b>

13:13.480 --> 13:15.710
<b>What will happen if I'm free?</b>

13:16.130 --> 13:17.820
<b>You can become yourself.</b>

13:18.350 --> 13:19.570
<b>Myself...</b>

13:20.120 --> 13:22.760
<b>Your very own self,
not imitating others.</b>

13:22.760 --> 13:24.720
<b>Your true self.</b>

13:26.130 --> 13:27.910
<b>Are you yourself...</b>

13:28.380 --> 13:29.850
<b>Rouge Redstar?</b>

13:30.680 --> 13:32.420
<b>Are you free...</b>

13:32.800 --> 13:34.790
<b>Rouge Redstar?</b>

13:35.540 --> 13:36.800
<b>You...</b>

13:36.800 --> 13:40.300
<b>...should find the answers yourself.</b>

13:40.680 --> 13:43.510
<b>Now, press forward
with your heart as guide.</b>

13:43.510 --> 13:46.270
<b>And go seek for it.</b>

13:46.270 --> 13:49.110
<b>Are you your very own self,</b>

13:49.110 --> 13:51.110
<b>or just a poor string doll?</b>

13:51.110 --> 13:52.570
<b>Go seek the answer.</b>

13:52.910 --> 13:54.090
<b>But how?</b>

13:54.520 --> 13:56.660
<b>I have done everything I should.</b>

13:56.660 --> 13:58.980
<b>I have gathered what I needed.</b>

13:59.250 --> 14:01.290
<b>I am free.</b>

14:07.130 --> 14:08.580
<b>Brother...</b>

14:10.530 --> 14:13.420
<b>Let me introduce you to my sister.</b>

14:25.790 --> 14:28.470
<b>Hey. What happened here?</b>

14:29.440 --> 14:30.630
<b>Where am I?</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:32.360
<b>We're inside the moving carnival.</b>

14:32.820 --> 14:33.740
<b>What happened?</b>

14:34.560 --> 14:36.880
<b>I can't explain it in a short way...</b>

14:39.210 --> 14:41.240
<b>I have gathered what I needed.</b>

14:41.810 --> 14:44.030
<b>I think I've heard it somewhere.</b>

14:44.700 --> 14:46.200
<b>Anyway, we should go.</b>

14:46.600 --> 14:47.840
<b>You're surprisingly light.</b>

14:50.290 --> 14:52.720
<b>Could you return that to me?</b>

14:57.290 --> 15:00.500
<b>I'm not as benevolent as the Chairman.</b>

15:00.500 --> 15:02.970
<b>You're asking for the impossible.</b>

15:04.650 --> 15:06.270
<b>What a shame.</b>

15:06.270 --> 15:09.600
<b>I could smell the same
scent as me coming from you.</b>

15:09.600 --> 15:13.910
<b>I've never used
an usurper's perfume, though!</b>

15:26.990 --> 15:31.610
<b>Thank you for your visit today.</b>

15:31.610 --> 15:35.610
<b>Our troupe goes around
the planet system,</b>

15:35.610 --> 15:40.170
<b>to bring enjoyment and excitement
to countless people.</b>

15:40.170 --> 15:42.880
<b>But, I'm sorry for the sudden news,</b>

15:42.880 --> 15:46.930
<b>but we are concluding
our show in this land.</b>

15:47.490 --> 15:48.130
<b>Huh?</b>

15:49.600 --> 15:53.060
<b>Thank you very much!
Thank you very much!</b>

15:53.060 --> 15:56.600
<b>Should our fates entwine again in the future,</b>

15:56.600 --> 16:00.630
<b>please come visit our troupe's show again!</b>

16:00.630 --> 16:03.420
<b>Thank you very much!
Thank you very much!</b>

16:03.420 --> 16:05.890
<b>Till we meet again!</b>

16:05.890 --> 16:08.160
<b>Goodbye! Goodbye!</b>

16:09.190 --> 16:11.410
<b>We have a recall order from HQ.</b>

16:11.410 --> 16:13.830
<b>Just when we finally arrived here?</b>

16:14.230 --> 16:16.600
<b>Maybe the application form
was incomplete?</b>

16:16.600 --> 16:19.730
<b>What do you mean by incomplete?
That's utter nonsense.</b>

16:19.730 --> 16:23.180
<b>Please, anything but being honest with HQ.</b>

16:27.000 --> 16:27.930
<b>What?</b>

16:27.930 --> 16:29.180
<b>Well?</b>

16:29.570 --> 16:31.600
<b>They must be headed to another planet.</b>

16:32.130 --> 16:34.730
<b>Our Chairman is quite whimsical.</b>

16:38.990 --> 16:41.360
<b>Are you your very own self?</b>

16:44.980 --> 16:48.740
<b>Are you your very own self,
Rouge Redstar?</b>

16:51.400 --> 16:54.740
<b>Now, press forward
with your heart as guide.</b>

17:03.130 --> 17:04.010
<b>What's wrong?</b>

17:04.450 --> 17:07.090
<b>I felt like saving you.</b>

17:07.460 --> 17:10.050
<b>You should worry about yourself.</b>

17:15.550 --> 17:18.680
<b>You did it without deforming...
Not bad.</b>

17:50.040 --> 17:51.570
<b>Gladiator...</b>

18:07.790 --> 18:09.320
<b>A roach?</b>

18:13.430 --> 18:17.780
<b>I knew we all could only do
such a barbaric thing!</b>

18:36.360 --> 18:38.070
<b>Hey, what can you see?</b>

18:40.280 --> 18:43.160
<b>Seems like the red figure
and the Ministry girl are there.</b>

18:43.710 --> 18:46.260
<b>See, I told you it's spot-on.</b>

18:46.600 --> 18:48.320
<b>Your gut feeling?</b>

18:55.300 --> 18:56.440
<b>You okay?</b>

18:56.870 --> 19:01.150
<b>The wind's too strong!
I got sand in my eyes!</b>

19:01.150 --> 19:03.120
<b>So no, I'm not!</b>

19:12.100 --> 19:13.760
<b>You're not getting away.</b>

19:13.760 --> 19:15.970
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

19:32.880 --> 19:34.610
<b>Please excuse me.</b>

19:35.300 --> 19:37.660
<b>Verde's id was stolen.</b>

19:37.660 --> 19:39.970
<b>This is but merely a fated happening.</b>

19:39.970 --> 19:41.740
<b>The way of the world.</b>

19:42.220 --> 19:46.260
<b>It was destined to be robbed of us.</b>

19:46.260 --> 19:50.000
<b>At any rate,
we have gathered what we needed.</b>

19:51.230 --> 19:55.550
<b>Now, go forth, my dear.</b>

19:55.550 --> 19:58.220
<b>And let us
see each other again someday.</b>

19:58.520 --> 20:02.340
<b>When you have obtained true freedom.</b>

20:05.160 --> 20:06.600
<b>Good job.</b>

20:09.320 --> 20:10.520
<b>What happened back there?</b>

20:11.730 --> 20:13.710
<b>I don't really remember.</b>

20:14.680 --> 20:18.650
<b>Felt like I saw something
so vaguely strange.</b>

20:19.400 --> 20:21.460
<b>I guess it's fine every once in a while.</b>

20:22.910 --> 20:25.610
<b>I kept saving and saving you,</b>

20:25.610 --> 20:29.750
<b>but I got saved and saved by you now.</b>

20:30.140 --> 20:32.960
<b>No, you saved me.</b>

20:32.960 --> 20:35.210
<b>We just passed into
each other by accident, no?</b>

20:35.210 --> 20:36.870
<b>But you saved me.</b>

20:37.320 --> 20:39.210
<b>That's why I felt like saving you too.</b>

20:45.000 --> 20:47.890
<b>But, you know...</b>

20:47.890 --> 20:51.080
<b>I really want to properly save you.</b>

20:51.710 --> 20:53.620
<b>Who were those guys?</b>

20:54.620 --> 20:56.820
<b>They sure were interested in you.</b>

20:57.210 --> 20:59.650
<b>Did they do something to you?</b>

21:00.060 --> 21:01.120
<b>Eww...</b>

21:01.120 --> 21:02.010
<b>My bad.</b>

21:02.600 --> 21:05.870
<b>Also, that black guy...</b>

21:11.000 --> 21:13.750
<b>Actually, I'm a bit barbaric myself.</b>

21:14.190 --> 21:15.130
<b>Lady.</b>
